# Small hanja dictionary for the hangul.vendored.hanja test.
#
# Format (see the HanjaTable docs in engines/libhangul/hangul/hanja.c): UTF-8,
# key:value:comment, one entry per line, sorted ascending by key bytes, '#'
# introduces a comment line. Keeping the dictionary tiny and ours keeps the
# expected output stable — driving the vendored program against the shipped
# 6 MB hanja.txt would tie the test to data upstream is free to extend.
#
# The leading comment lines are not decoration: hanja_table_load() skips them
# while building its offset index, and the first indexed entry has to still
# point at the right place afterwards.
가:可:comment-one
가:家:
가나:假名:comment-two
한자:漢字:comment-three
